WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.792 --> 00:00:03.625
In Sodden,

00:00:04.458 --> 00:00:05.917
we banded together

00:00:06.792 --> 00:00:09.250
to fight not only
for the future of magic,

00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:12.500
but for the future
of the Continent.

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:15.833
Our victory came at a great cost.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:18.708
Today,

00:00:18.792 --> 00:00:21.250
we must unite
against a common enemy.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:27.833
This is what strength looks like.

00:00:32.458 --> 00:00:34.417
Yennefer of Vengerberg

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:37.333
survived fire magic.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:42.875
Yennefer has only ever
known magic.

00:00:42.958 --> 00:00:45.333
She is powerful and unpredictable.

00:00:45.417 --> 00:00:48.458
And as a consequence
of using fire magic,

00:00:48.542 --> 00:00:50.417
she is wanted.

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:52.167
But she's been captured.

00:00:53.875 --> 00:00:55.958
Do you really think
offering me as a sacrifice

00:00:56.042 --> 00:00:57.750
will be enough
to spare your failure?

00:00:57.833 --> 00:01:00.208
I know that my faith
brought me this far.

00:01:00.292 --> 00:01:02.000
I'll see how much further
it can take me.

00:01:02.083 --> 00:01:03.667
Fringilla doesn't
leave anything unturned.

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:05.458
She knows she needs
to rebuild an army

00:01:05.542 --> 00:01:07.375
and she knows
she's gonna come back.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:13.917
We won, but barely.

00:01:14.667 --> 00:01:16.875
We don't know the troops
that Nilfgaard have in reserve.

00:01:19.667 --> 00:01:23.417
Tissaia, she has a very strong idea
of what is the right thing to do.

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:28.125
What's motivating her is to try
and shift the balance of power.

00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:33.167
The hero kills the enemy.

00:01:33.875 --> 00:01:37.125
For her, it's very much a battle
between good and evil.

00:01:38.167 --> 00:01:39.583
What a welcome sight.

00:01:39.667 --> 00:01:41.083
Surprise.

00:01:46.375 --> 00:01:48.750
Triss is definitely a powerful mage.

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:52.750
But she's looking for
that human connection,

00:01:52.833 --> 00:01:54.375
and that seems to coincide

00:01:54.458 --> 00:01:56.958
with Geralt needing a bit of help
at Kaer Morhen.

00:01:57.042 --> 00:01:58.917
I brought her here
to help guide you.

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:00.958
I have a friend
who studies monoliths.

00:02:01.542 --> 00:02:04.958
I think in a world
with so much violence,

00:02:06.417 --> 00:02:08.375
a character like Istredd
is refreshing.

00:02:08.958 --> 00:02:11.667
There's a mystery there.
He's one step ahead of the game.

00:02:11.750 --> 00:02:14.625
His journey is kind of dictated
by trying to find out

00:02:14.708 --> 00:02:16.833
about the monolith
and how they all link.

00:02:16.917 --> 00:02:19.958
They hold the history
of this Continent.

00:02:21.458 --> 00:02:23.042
And I think
they hold our future too.

00:02:30.958 --> 00:02:32.833
At least conjure me up
some decent food

00:02:32.917 --> 00:02:34.167
before we get to to Shitgaard.

